-# ui-design-engineer-eval-greenfield
+# Ingress — API Traffic Analytics Dashboard
 
-Scratch repo for the `ui-design-engineer` skill's greenfield eval tests (see
-`ui-design-engineer/evals/evaluation-suite.md`). `main` stays empty — each
-test branches off it and scaffolds its own project state per that test's
-"Setup" description (e.g. an empty-commit branch for Test D/L-style tests).
+A real-time dashboard for API traffic: throughput, error rate, latency percentiles,
+and per-endpoint health.
 
-Fresh as of 2026-08-26 — the previous run's worktrees and seed branches were
-cleared out after `evals/results/2026-08-24-opencode-claude-v1.2.0` captured
-their results.
+## Stack
+
+React 19 + TypeScript + Vite, Tailwind CSS v4 (OKLCH semantic tokens), Recharts.
+
+## Running
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run dev
+```
+
+## Data
+
+There is no backend. `src/lib/trafficEngine.ts` runs an in-memory traffic
+simulation (Poisson-ish request volume, log-normal-ish latency, occasional
+randomized incidents) and ticks every 2 seconds. See `DESIGN.md` §20 for how to
+swap it for a real metrics source without changing the UI layer.
+
+## Design decisions
+
+See `DESIGN.md` for the full design system record (tokens, archetype, and a
+decision log), and `worker-report.md` for a summary of what was built and why.
